OL,3,GNEWSAPolice warn trespassing is putting
OL,4,Alives 'at risk'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have warned people are putting
OL,7,Ftheir lives at risk by trespassing in
OL,8,Fdangerous buildings in Mansfield.
OL,10,FBuildings at "imminent risk of
OL,11,Fcollapse" are among those to have been
OL,12,Faccessed by young people in recent
OL,13,Fmonths, according to Nottinghamshire
OL,14,FPolice.
OL,16,FThe force said the B&M supermarket
OL,17,Fbuilding in Stockwell Gate and the
OL,18,FWalkden Street car park above it, which
OL,19,Fpartially collapsed in August 2025,
OL,20,Fwere among the sites targeted by young
OL,21,Fpeople taking part in an urban
OL,22,Fexploring trend.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
