OL,3,GNEWSAPolice warn trespassing is putting
OL,4,Alives 'at risk'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPC Louise Martin said: "It is no
OL,7,Fexaggeration to say that many of the
OL,8,Fpeople involved in this trend are
OL,9,Fputting their lives at risk, all in
OL,10,Fpursuit of online views and bragging
OL,11,Frights."
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
